=2 Walkthrough
* Examine the {p:Veridical Conflux} in {z:Grauberg (S)} at (F-5) for a cutscene. You will be transported to {p:Walk of Echoes}.
** If Walk of Echoes was the last dawndrop you did from the last mission, you must exit and examine the {p:Veridical Conflux} for the cutscene.
* Examine the **Ornate Door** north of the Verdical Conflux in the Walk of Echoes for a cutscene; examine it again to enter the BC Maiden of the Dusk.
* Your opponent in this BC is {m:Lilith}; she casts AoE enfeebling spells, and has two forms.
** In the {m:first form|Lilith}:
*** Her regular melee attacks are AoE and cause {p:knockback|Knockback}, and she has a weaponskill with the additional effect of {s:Dispel}.
*** Aside from AoE enfeebling spells, she casts {s:Comet}, and at low HP, {s:Meteor}.
*** She can use {p:Trance} multiple times. While under trance, she can use a gaze weaponskill called **Fatal Attraction** which will {p:charm|Charm (Status)}; this can be avoided by turning away from her.
*** After defeating the first form, there will be a cutscene and you will return to the entry point of the battlefield to rest and buff again if needed.
** In her {m:second form|Lilith Ascendant}:
*** Her weaponskills are Dark Flare, Dark Burst, Dark Quake, Dark Freeze, Dark Tornado; they are conal attacks that do sizable amounts of damage.
*** She also has a weaponskill called Dark Moon that causes {p:Weakness} for a short period of time.
*** She summons {m:Elemental Gyves} which can be nuked down fairly easily. Avoid standing in them when possible.
**** Red gives {s:Burn} and Attack Down.
**** Cyan gives {s:Frost} and Magic Attack Down.
**** Yellow gives {s:Rasp} and Defense Down.
**** Green gives {s:Choke} and Evasion Down.
**** Blue gives {s:Drown} and Magic Defense Down.
**** Purple gives {s:Shock} and Accuracy Down.
**** White gives {s:Dia} and {p:Disease}.
**** Black gives {s:Bio} and a 5 second {p:Doom} effect. Two appear after Dark Moon. **Be especially careful of this one.**
*** Her two hour is Dark Sun; it is AoE {s:Death} in approximately a 15 yalm radius __(verification needed)__. She will say a line before she uses it, so be prepared to run when she is under 50%.
** Both phases are rather trivial at ilvl 119, but advise caution on **Fatal Attraction**.
* The mission will be complete after a 10 minute cutscene with Lady Lilith, Lilisette and Cait Sith.
** After this cutscene, you may buy the {p:HTMB|High-Tier Mission Battlefields} KI {k:Maiden phantom gem} for 10 {p:Merit Points}.
* If you are defeated, wait for the next game day and check the {z:Grauberg (S)} {p:Veridical Conflux} to get another {@k}{k:Primal glow}.

